<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 39.98 to 6308.33.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.92 to 382.77.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.20.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1246 to 1240.</p>
<p>Volume was 519,835,560, compared with 447,583,770 Monday.</p>
